	(descr "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 socket set: 2x22 THT female headers on 2.54mm pitch, rows 22.86mm apart. Pads named for DevKit signals. Courtyard is the DEVKIT BODY plus its antenna keepout. Carries a vertical CENTRELINE on silk for left/right alignment. Expands at assembly into 2x LCSC C41376161 (Hong Cheng HC-PM254-8.5H-1x22PZ).")
